BT 1 0 0 1 0 54.15 Tm 12.6 TL /F1 8.85 Tf .12549 .164706 .192157 rg (This project trains a causal language model from random initialization on the supplied WikiText-2 training text. The course) Tj T* (baseline uses learned absolute position embeddings in a four-block GPT with width 128. I first replaced those embeddings) Tj T* (with rotary position encoding \(RoPE\) in attention, then increased the RoPE model width from 128 to 192. The final selected) Tj T* (model was trained for 4,800 updates and obtained ) Tj /F2 8.85 Tf (1.642035 validation BPB) Tj /F1 8.85 Tf ( and ) Tj /F2 8.85 Tf (1.665363 full-test BPB) Tj /F1 8.85 Tf ( with FP32 CPU) Tj T* (scoring. The initial baseline obtained 2.071088 validation BPB and 2.101266 full-test BPB. Lower BPB is better.) Tj T* ET
